  dialogLines:
  - 'Thankfully, this isn''t the key to my mansion... '
  - "Nope! Just the key to that golden\u2026. statue over there. Pretty sure it's
    fake gold. "
  - Golden? Golden like that delicious and priceless golden acorn?
  - 'Golden acorn? Never heard of it. Sounds like my kind of thing, though. '
  - "Maybe there's a key out there that leads you to the golden acorn\u2026 "
  - "You better be quick. I\u2019m sure other nutjobs are looking for the same thing."
